{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-22T03:03:50.812Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-2","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"8fcf1176eceedef40be11ce4","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-2","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"medium","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"release-operator","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-l6wdvh","claim:pm-xp7ldt","claim:pm-zi34i1","release:pm-998juj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-l6wdvh+pm-xp7ldt+pm-zi34i1","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-l6wdvh","claim:pm-xp7ldt","claim:pm-zi34i1","release:pm-998juj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-22T03:03:50.811Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"First Codex review findings on the bulk admission, each verified and fixed in the follow-up commit. options.id and list.id passed admission and selected nothing, so the update would have reached every matching row: id is refused with an ids hint and a nested list record admits list selection keys only. A misspelled top-level argument was not judged: the action envelope is now checked and a misplaced field names options.<key>. Outer author, message and force beside a nested update record were admitted but dropped by the normalizer: updateManyOptionsFromFlat now carries them into the record unless the record states its own. output_format and documentAnnotationSnapshot, which the dispatch consumes, were refused: snake_case run and output controls and the annotation snapshot guard are admitted."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-22T03:03:50.812Z"}],"before_hash":"14c477008dbc4fe58bdf994b037a58ea487fa58a297f3bd3bd3df5b40ce06b52","after_hash":"3c18f5ea2d9b05a32f45f797499d4a7071c606c27